{"displayStem":"특이 펩타이드–MHC I 표면 복합체를 표지하고 새 공급을 차단하였다. 세포 생존은 같고 내재화와 해리의 개별 기여는 구분하지 않았다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"직접 설계한 교육용 합성 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C06 c06-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 345\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 자료 모식도\"><defs><marker id=\"c06arr\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 3.5L0 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path></marker><pattern id=\"c06hatch\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 8L8 0\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></pattern></defs><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"><text x=\"55\" y=\"25\" text-anchor=\"start\">표면 복합체 (시작 대비 %)</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"465\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"165\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"265\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"265\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"265\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"365\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"365\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"465\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"465\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"465\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"52\" y=\"247\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"193.75\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"193.75\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"52\" y=\"200.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">25</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"147.5\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"147.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"52\" y=\"154.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">50</text><lin